  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering Holocaust denial and distortion through education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to empower educators and media professionals to engage with the history and remembrance of the Holocaust as responsible global citizens and to contribute to efforts to counter its denial and distortion to ensure more peaceful and just societies. It will achieve this by developing guidance documents to support training, learning materials for students and capacity building opportunities for educational and media professionals. 

To alert the public on the dangers of Holocaust denial and distortion to democratic institutions and human rights, and its contemporary manifestations, UNESCO will continue to support the #ProtectTheFacts social media campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
